/! Challenge
section#challenge.challenge
  .container
	.row.align-items-center.g-5
	  .col-lg-5
		h2 The challenge

		p.lead.text-mb-5
		  | CaptiveColour Cosmetics was entering a crowded cosmetics market filled with established brands and an abundance of choices for consumers. As a new brand with no existing audience or recognition, the challenge was creating a distinct identity and product experience that could capture attention, build credibility, and give customers a reason to engage.

		p.lead
		  | At the same time, the brand had to be built from the ground up. From product research and manufacturer selection to packaging, e-commerce, and marketing, each decision needed to work together to create a cohesive experience and successfully introduce CaptiveColour to the market.

	  .col-lg-7
		= link_to image_path("portfolio/captivecolour/captivecolour-lipsticks.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Five CaptiveColour matte liquid lipstick shades displayed in a product lineup" do
